  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During the anti-Fang alliance battle, Zuo Qiu San Sha stays at the back of the alliance army preparing a killer move whose aura nears completion. Narration says Fang clan has roof tile breaker to restrain Immortal Gu Houses, and that Zuo Qiu also has a similar move called state of disunity, created by Zuo Qiu San Sha.",
      "chapters": [
        2258
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_fang_clan",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State of disunity is similar to roof tile breaker; both counter Immortal Gu Houses. Zuo Qiu San Sha, who possesses that move, is the key person the alliance needs to suppress Fang clan. Fang Di Chang orders Fang Zhi and Fang Dong Xi to stop him from activating it. Smoke Wave Building pours smoke to engulf him, then Fang Di Chang’s Thought Expelling Pavilion targets him. As he closes in, his thoughts fly out of his mind and circle his body, the Gu worms in his immortal aperture fall into chaos, the killer move fails, and he coughs blood under the backlash. Tuoba Cheng Feng moves to save him.",
      "chapters": [
        2259
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "key-suppressor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_di_chang",
        "char_fang_zhi",
        "char_fang_dong_xi",
        "house_smoke_wave_building",
        "house_thought_expelling_pavilion",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later comparison again pairs Fang clan’s roof tile breaker with Zuo Qiu clan’s state of disunity as counters to Immortal Gu Houses.",
      "chapters": [
        2267
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-counter-named",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
